{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "取", "id": "取"}, {"form": "悅", "id": "悅"}, {"form": "戕", "id": "戕"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "桮", "id": "桮"}, {"form": "棬", "id": "棬"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}, {"form": "路", "id": "路"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8758425864385964, "source": "路", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.8758425864385964, "source": "取", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.6526990351243867, "source": "義", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 1.6526990351243867, "source": "義", "target": "棬"}, {"weight": 1.9403811075761677, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.470377478330432, "source": "義", "target": "戕"}, {"weight": 1.470377478330432, "source": "義", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 1.6526990351243867, "source": "義", "target": "內"}, {"weight": 1.8758425864385964, "source": "義", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 2.1635246588903776, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.8758425864385964, "source": "義", "target": "悅"}, {"weight": 2.5689897669985418, "source": "義", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 3.903990833730882, "source": "棬", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 1.1959406326286717, "source": "棬", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.4985257256227174, "source": "棬", "target": "戕"}, {"weight": 3.4985257256227174, "source": "棬", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 3.4985257256227174, "source": "戕", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 4.4148164574968725, "source": "戕", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 1.7067662563946624, "source": "戕", "t